    "reason": "Fresh official searches returned no Assistance Listing for either '6G' or 'advanced communications'. They did return 11.038, Public Wireless Supply Chain Innovation Fund Grant Program, for both 'wireless' and the exact listing number. The exact transaction-level query returns three nonzero annual rows for FY2023-FY2025 and one complete FY2025 row of $409,852,406.47; a same-session replay was byte-identical, and a complete hasNext=false listing-category response reproduces the FY2025 amount. The official federal-account catalog separately identifies 013-0565 as Public Wireless Supply Chain Innovation Fund, National Telecommunications and Information Administration, Commerce, but the account and AL totals are not equal, and the AL awarding-subagency category assigns the awards to NIST. The verified series is therefore only the AL-wide award-transaction aggregate. It is a recurring advanced-wireless context series, not a bill execution metric and not an account-obligation series.",
    "scope": {
      "verifiedConcept": "Signed net federal_action_obligation aggregated across prime financial-assistance award transactions whose Assistance Listing is 11.038, grouped by action-date federal fiscal year.",
